        rBurnTitle: "🔥 Burn Cards",
        rBurnDesc: "An <strong>invalid slap</strong> forces you to burn a card from your hand — it goes to a separate penalty pile. When anyone wins the pile, burn cards are awarded at the very bottom of the winner's deck before the played pile.",
        rTimeoutTitle: "⏱️ AFK / Idle Timeout",
        rTimeoutDesc: "If a player fails to play a card within the allowed time (Easy: 20s, Medium: 15s, Hard: 10s, Challenger: 15s), they automatically <strong>burn a card</strong> and the turn passes to the next player.",
        rCalibTitle: "📊 Reflex Speed Analytics",
        rCalibDesc: "Every successful slap tracks your reaction time in milliseconds! View your best reflex speed and personal reaction trend curve graph directly in your Profile. Compare your speed against the simulated Challenger Bots (which also run in Multiplayer Mode)!",
        rPerfectTitle: "🎯 Perfect Slap precision",
        rPerfectDesc: "Slapping very close to the center of the pile (within 15 pixels) triggers a <strong>Perfect Slap</strong> bonus! Triggers special neon star particles and custom sound chime multipliers.",
        rShieldTitle: "🛡️ Combustion Shield",
        rShieldDesc: "Achieving a <strong>3-slap streak</strong> (slaps only) activates a fiery <strong>Combustion Shield</strong> valid for <strong>30 seconds</strong>! Performing another successful slap within 30s renews the shield timer. The shield protects your deck from burning a card once per activation by shattering.",
